1. Create /Users/shivshankardash/warden/src/explain/verdict.ts with JSDoc header. Export the main function:

   export async function explainVerdict(
     result: ScanResult,
     content: string,
     opts?: {
       mode?: 'fast' | 'rich';
       includeContent?: boolean;
       reputation?: Reputation | null;
       sessionInfo?: { turnCount: number; sessionRisk: number } | null;
     }
   ): Promise<string>;

   Import types from src/types.ts: ScanResult, Finding, Action, Stage, AttackType.
   Import Reputation from src/store/reputation.ts.
   The function delegates to fastExplain() or richExplain() based on opts.mode (default 'fast').
